# 17.6 Indexes

| Index | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| idx_folders_profile_id | Retrieve a user's folders |
| idx_folders_folder_type | Filter by folder category |
| idx_folders_created_at | Sort folders by creation date |

Composite index:

```sql
CREATE INDEX idx_folders_profile_folder
ON folders(profile_id, folder_type);
```

